\fs6\
\fs8\
\f1 \b0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Posted when the application exits context-sensitive help mode. This happens when the user clicks the mouse anywhere on the screen after displaying a context-sensitive help topic. \
\fs14\
\fs28 The notification contains:\
\fs14\
\pard \s60 \li6753 \fi-4838 \ri1007 \ql \tx6753 \tx9525 \fs28 \b Notification Object\b0 \tab The NSHelpManager object\
